[m
NAME[m
       at,  batch, atq, atrm - queue, examine, or delete jobs for later execu‐[m
       tion[m
[m
SYNOPSIS[m
       at [-V] [-q queue] [-f file] [-u username] [-mMlv] timespec ...[m
       at [-V] [-q queue] [-f file] [-u username] [-mMkv] [-t time][m
       at -c job [...][m
       at [-V] -l [-o timeformat] [job ...][m
       atq [-V] [-q queue] [-o timeformat] [job ...][m
       at [-rd] job [...][m
       atrm [-V] job [...][m
       batch[m
       at -b[m
[m
DESCRIPTION[m
       at and batch read commands from standard  input  or  a  specified  file[m
       which are to be executed at a later time, using /bin/sh.[m
[m
       at      executes commands at a specified time.[m
